{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "87e83e32a25827d6788f5673e25ea4561f8ac277e7480bba7a15f8e188455917", "ja": "（とうとう、茜の初公演だ。さすがに、\n今日くらいは緊張している……いや、どうかな……）", "zh": "（终于到了茜首次公演的日子。就算是茜，\n今天这种日子应该也会紧张……不，这很难说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "8081e4bde1217f5a4667d71a9b35cced939ac915c10bd663d91f22dd4ebf48fa", "ja": "いや～、今日の劇場は超満員だね！　みんな\n茜ちゃんのデビューを観に来たのかな～、感心感心♪", "zh": "哎呀～今天的剧场超客满呢！\n大家都是来看小茜出道的吗～很好很好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "740d30f77d725c1fc6b54c0e052734a5888e54ca1deef2e888d89ec82eb8a027", "ja": "（してなかった……）", "zh": "（她没在紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "06a7a3dce5b946d898992490fa0815966d12436cb6a98fc2f35d2d8f40275baf", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃんだー！\nいやっほー！", "zh": "啊，是小{$P$}──！\n嗨──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b7c29870c851feb30977f8d74606135a7f37b7f64e0972c848a89ef66c543eb", "ja": "あれ、なんか顔がひきつってるよ？\nもしかして、緊張してるのかな～？　んん？", "zh": "奇怪，你表情有点僵耶？\n该不会在紧张吧？是吗是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c7556ebc92f34ad39b2f08a916adce8de0ee80398ce66edec52538666560eb4", "ja": "そういう茜は、緊張してないのか？", "zh": "我才想问茜呢，你会不会紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "58dc820b8ec0b1f2686f949aa45c5bcacfa67de19f967b85d2dd66ae95fd5dcd", "ja": "茜ちゃんは基本、なんでもできるからね！\n茜ちゃんの辞書には、カワイイという文字しかなーい！", "zh": "因为小茜基本上是万能的啊！\n小茜的字典里就只写着可爱两个字──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "10e002d264f41e356c08e65c91b500247269473232a5c957fdd7b98ef0ac78c2", "ja": "なんて使いづらそうな辞書なんだ……。", "zh": "怎么觉得这字典不太好用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "ac431892762d9c94e43693df4e76e7dce05c34062d370d799550847f910a7491", "ja": "おっ、言うね{$P$}ちゃん！\nそのとおり！　だが、それもまた喜び！", "zh": "喔，真会说呢，小{$P$}！\n没错！但小茜还是觉得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0ca80eaff06e359ee92a12d0227021f6de7b9db1ac00a24dfcf4ce28d9cb0373", "ja": "というか……、いくらなんでも、\n緊張感がなさすぎないか？", "zh": "话说……无论如何，\n你也太缺乏紧张感了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "1e4c726c32b163f1eed4f9c6aaa44a3e91853fd86c9a292e562f58ede03e740f", "ja": "えー？　{$P$}ちゃんこそ、\n緊張しすぎなんじゃないの？", "zh": "咦──？小{$P$}才是，\n会不会紧张过头了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "e390aa6e3fc7264f12c30e29d1de7f975aff0321a26627a2eeffebe4476e6611", "ja": "おっと、そろそろ時間だね！　茜ちゃん衝撃の\nデビューステージ、みんなの目に焼き付けてくるよ！", "zh": "哦，时间差不多了！\n小茜这就带来冲击的出道表演，让大家永生难忘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "52f28fdb5639041c57a4bb8921fa2defcb3d8122328c0b613125588b1b65b232", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、何か言っておくコトが\nあるなら、聞いておいてあげるよ！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "小{$P$}，如果你有话要说，\n小茜愿意听一下！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bb948eb4fd6fb2daeda4b503a44f66cdeb7f51a8219704a1e6a6722ef3ad0ca3", "ja": "茜……。", "zh": "茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_1014", "source_sha256": "0b5aff6a916568b28a744fb3f977e68836787ca71f05a2a1851567d23c9c51cb", "ja": "絶対に失敗するな", "zh": "绝对别失败", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "941ef97de31e26d43af75c99c6ed1692e9dfe88a4f6e031c7494873840efb00e", "ja": "いいか、絶対に失敗するなよ！\n約束だ！", "zh": "听好了，绝对别失败喔！\n这是约定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d4f7ed15826b172ac749b961aefe3d6f0922fe6b62bf21214f38d849c0dfc3b", "ja": "ニャっ！？　きゅ、急にどうしたのさ！？\nそんな、茜ちゃん世代にはキツイ一言を……！", "zh": "喵！？你、你突然说什么啦！？\n这话对小茜这种年轻人来说很沉重耶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_2002", "source_sha256": "75b24f3e70fc0ab06154891d1e73718e43c7c779fd61b20fc59646cd248552ce", "ja": "大勢の人が支えてる", "zh": "有很多人在支持你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_3000_p", "source_sha256": "9a3a1561dacc4bdf4fa6215487b4ccf3622586084c567d7faca2bf86a44c0410", "ja": "今日の茜の初舞台のために、みんなが\nたくさん応援してくれたんだ。忘れるなよ！", "zh": "茜今天首次登台表演，有很多人支持着你。\n别忘了这点喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_3001_023aka", "source_sha256": "33ac0026e3195a12afdd886c0d7e779cbeab283520e3b7249a35e5535a361d96", "ja": "うぅっ！　{$P$}ちゃんが、\n茜ちゃんにプレッシャーをかけてくるぅー！", "zh": "呜呜！小{$P$}\n在给小茜施压──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_3002", "source_sha256": "cfbb63a42ae4c55866ff6598c2bf5c7253bbd912fe7d7d2bf2f4b6eca898d13c", "ja": "劇場のみんなが応援してる", "zh": "剧场的伙伴们也在为你加油", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4000_p", "source_sha256": "ed7819ab232b84196eaa7cc19094b4ee56f59838e5231924b6464eea8d28edd3", "ja": "みんなも、茜と一緒にステージに立てるのを\nすごく楽しみにしてたんだ。よかったな！", "zh": "大家都很期待能和茜一起站上舞台。\n真是太好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4001_023aka", "source_sha256": "14160ca13ac9a0f244fdcb564e5493ca41fff9ae536adcd15e3e5bce2220bc7b", "ja": "ごふぅっ！？\nとっ、トドメの一撃が……！", "zh": "咳呜！？\n致、致命的一击……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4002_023aka", "source_sha256": "3f664ab3df7754e72b45e9140657fcf31fcc7726d4a2f5c07c9ca681235cd715", "ja": "劇場のみんなに言われた励ましの言葉が、\n鋭い刃となって茜ちゃんのハートに突き刺さるぅー！", "zh": "剧场伙伴们说过的鼓励，\n化为利刃刺向小茜的心──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4003_p", "source_sha256": "acab2aa68a4524fb76d44efbd86a08d87206b72c57ee31a7ba47fcb933617235", "ja": "でも、気合いが入っただろ？\nよかったじゃないか！", "zh": "不过，让你提起干劲了吧？\n这不是很好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4004_023aka", "source_sha256": "1a8058cd380d79c55fbd35eed3f3af436c8757b2a9c826126ebdce38e1ea0917", "ja": "むむむ……。\n{$P$}ちゃんのくせに、粋なコトを！", "zh": "唔唔唔……区区小{$P$}，\n居然这样耍帅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4005_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9b433ea08804e8b80790721454f99572881fd1b0e575b5c444297ad0955d491", "ja": "いいよ！　{$P$}ちゃんとみんなに\n茜ちゃんのサイコーにカワイイとこ見せてあげるから！", "zh": "好啊！就让小{$P$}和大家\n看看小茜最可爱的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4006_023aka", "source_sha256": "a15c55b4c1f68c7a06a96f2886d3c3b2620c7538e1e372ed884883c16027320e", "ja": "それじゃ、いってきまーす！\nと、その前に！", "zh": "那么小茜要上场了──！\n啊，在那之前！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4007_p", "source_sha256": "a4d14b5b7ac5706c12b66bad682c238081555529989aa5ae24f11df9eda9a79d", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4008_023aka", "source_sha256": "10b8f5f7c28cf064828a00b3765135105250c9d88cecf31203dee90bc5224601", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんのこと、\nちゃんと褒めておいてあげないと～と思って！", "zh": "想说要好好地称赞一下\n小{$P$}啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4009_023aka", "source_sha256": "6de88274a3decc4c36326d7db757e22f98ac2195925c068ce0642ab29841815f", "ja": "いやあ、茜ちゃんがスカウトされてあげた頃から、\n{$P$}ちゃんも成長したね……。", "zh": "哎呀，跟小茜好意让你发掘那时相比，\n小{$P$}也成长了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4010_p", "source_sha256": "47ccd755cb08c6be9afdb6c24c2baa8f9d884f445c7ea51e74188eeffd179f4f", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nありがとう……。", "zh": "是、是吗？\n谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4011_023aka", "source_sha256": "4e380ee605b36943292c7585e5b97433d119f88864a360959da4f70db7fc2423", "ja": "しかし茜ちゃんマスターへの道はまだまだ遠いのだー！\nこれからも精進するように！　じゃ、いってきまーす♪", "zh": "不过距离小茜大师之路还远得很──！\n今后也要努力求进步喔！那小茜走了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4012_p", "source_sha256": "def88dad677a23d029b7efce7e4dd8aec8bf689f087912125a778667f98b6563", "ja": "ああ、いってこい！\nちゃんと見てるからな！", "zh": "嗯，去吧！\n我会好好看着的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4013_p", "source_sha256": "2927625072840ba5a9c77ba0b1a8cdf6ff911b5560b76e2f66da362da5885bcf", "ja": "（結局いつもどおりだったけど……\n気持ちは適度に引き締められたのかな）", "zh": "（虽然到头来还是跟平常一样……\n但应该有适度地让她认真一点吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_003_4014_p", "source_sha256": "80038454ac810e1391dc5a0c5bc9b727caba5409ea97c02a2aae7d147e84846a", "ja": "（さて、俺がマスターとやらになる頃には、\n茜はどんなアイドルになっているやら……）", "zh": "（等我成为那什么大师时，\n不知道茜会变成什么样的偶像呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
